"name\": \"spec.md\",\n        \"kind\": \"doc\",\n        \"path\": \"specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/spec.md\",\n        \"source\": \"derived\"\n      },\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w27ef8e22cd/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"a2a119","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
